    "b-10-installation-adding-a-provider-connec-13": {
      "id": "b-10-installation-adding-a-provider-connec-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Adding a provider connects Archon to your agent CLI or SDK; it does not install that CLI."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-installation-a-release-binary-runs-on-14": {
      "id": "b-10-installation-a-release-binary-runs-on-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "A release binary runs only the providers you add. Each one is a separate\nexecutable from the same release, verified against its "
        },
        {
          "insert": "checksums.txt",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " and\nrecorded under "
        },
        {
          "insert": "~/.archon/plugins/",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ":"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-installation-bash-15": {
      "id": "b-10-installation-bash-15",
      "type": "code",
      "props": {
        "language": "bash"
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "archon provider add codex          # one provider\narchon provider add claude codex pi"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-installation-archon-setup-asks-the-16": {
      "id": "b-10-installation-archon-setup-asks-the-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "archon setup",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " asks the same question and then walks through each provider's\nauthentication. The installers take the selection as "
        },
        {
          "insert": "--providers",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " (shell),\n"
        },
        {
          "insert": "-Providers",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " (PowerShell) or the "
        },
        {
          "insert": "ARCHON_PROVIDERS",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " environment variable, as a\ncomma-separated list; an empty value installs none. With no selection and no\nterminal to ask on, the installer installs none and prints the command.\nArchon never picks a provider for you: a workflow or chat message that needs a\nprovider you have not installed fails before it starts and names the add\ncommand."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-installation-an-installed-provider-mu-17": {
      "id": "b-10-installation-an-installed-provider-mu-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "An installed provider must match the CLI version. After upgrading Archon, run\n"
        },
        {
          "insert": "archon provider add",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " again for each provider you use; until then those\nruns fail with the command to run. Rerunning the quick installer asks again."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-installation-releases-up-to-0-11-1-pr-18": {
      "id": "b-10-installation-releases-up-to-0-11-1-pr-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Releases up to 0.11.1 predate "
        },
        {
          "insert": "archon provider",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " and bundle their providers. To\npin one with "
        },
        {
          "insert": "VERSION",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", skip the provider step with an empty selection\n("
        },
        {
          "insert": "--providers=",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " or "
        },
        {
          "insert": "-Providers ''",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "); otherwise the installer runs a command that\nrelease does not have and exits with an error."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-installation-docker-images-and-source-19": {
      "id": "b-10-installation-docker-images-and-source-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Docker images and source checkouts run Claude, Codex and Pi from source and need\nno install step."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-installation-using-archon-from-a-gui-20": {
      "id": "b-10-installation-using-archon-from-a-gui-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Using Archon from a GUI or service"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-installation-the-quick-installer-and-21": {
      "id": "b-10-installation-the-quick-installer-and-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The quick installer and Homebrew install a native, compiled "
        },
        {
          "insert": "archon",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " executable;\nthey do not require Bun at runtime. Each compiled invocation records its absolute\npath and version in "
        },
        {
          "insert": "<ARCHON_HOME>/install.json",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ":"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-installation-json-22": {
      "id": "b-10-installation-json-22",
      "type": "code",
      "props": {
        "language": "json"
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "{\n  \"binary\": \"/usr/local/bin/archon\",\n  \"version\": \"0.9.0\"\n}"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-installation-treat-this-file-as-a-dis-23": {
      "id": "b-10-installation-treat-this-file-as-a-dis-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Treat this file as a discovery hint, not executable configuration. An explicit\npath configured by the user always wins. Otherwise, read the manifest, require\n"
        },
        {
          "insert": "binary",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " to be an absolute executable path, and launch it directly. If the file\nis absent or invalid, fall back to the documented platform default or ask the\nuser to choose a binary. The quick-installer defaults are "
        },
        {
          "insert": "/usr/local/bin/archon",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "\non macOS/Linux and "
        },
        {
          "insert": "%USERPROFILE%\\.archon\\bin\\archon.exe",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " on Windows; expand\n"
        },
        {
          "insert": "%USERPROFILE%",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " to the user's home directory before invoking the Windows path."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-installation-the-last-compiled-archon-24": {
      "id": "b-10-installation-the-last-compiled-archon-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The last compiled Archon invoked updates the record when its path or version\nchanges. Quick installers create it during their final version check. Homebrew\ncreates it on first use. Source and Bun-linked invocations never write it."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-installation-the-source-install-and-25": {
      "id": "b-10-installation-the-source-install-and-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
